[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: SharpTestBench selection and verification requirements
UID: STB-SELECTION-SRS
VERSION: 1

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STB-033
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Deterministic regression selection
STATEMENT: The regression runtime shall select cases deterministically without weakening backend or test-isolation safeguards.
COMMENT: This existing task ID is retained. The refinements below cover selected behavior, not every criterion of the broader tracker issue.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STB-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Evidence-backed upstream surface mapping
STATEMENT: Upstream surface decisions shall identify the pinned source, the reviewed public exposure and the bounded implementation or gap.
COMMENT: Definition review does not establish completeness for aliases, dynamic exports or imported objects.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STB-007
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Native timing and failure qualification
STATEMENT: Native verification shall check accepted transactions, timing boundaries, failures and recovery against independent expected behavior.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STB-041
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Reproducible verification evidence
STATEMENT: Verification shall retain reproducible checks and distinguish execution evidence, code coverage and unmeasured behavior.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STB-SEL-001
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Qualified-name regex selection
STATEMENT: An immutable selection shall OR its regex alternatives over qualified case names and intersect existing stage, substring and exact-name filters. Empty alternatives shall be unrestricted. Matching shall use the documented invariant-culture .NET regex dialect.
RELATIONS:
