[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STB-SEL-002
STATUS: Active
TITLE: Immutable and bounded matcher configuration
STATEMENT: Configuration shall snapshot at most 64 non-null patterns of at most 4096 UTF-16 code units each and use a finite per-match timeout from one through 1000 milliseconds. Invalid mode, syntax or limits shall fail explicitly. Later caller mutation shall not change the selection.
RELATIONS:
